&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; specification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;: translate roadmap items into epics, user stories and testable acceptance criteria; lead backlog refinement, sprint planning and reviews; make trade&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;offs on scope, quality and timelines; coordinate release readiness and enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Incident triage &amp;amp; quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;: rapidly triage issues, gather context, coordinate fixes, run post&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;incident reviews and capture preventive actions in the backlog; communicate status to customer&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;facing teams and customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
